  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Scroll Menu Phone\n\nA generic phone frame with a menu list. The list scrolls with momentum, a touch dot taps an item, and the item expands to show its price and a Tambah button, which the dot then taps and a cart count appears. Names, descriptions and prices come from one variable.\n\nCategory: ui-blocks. Length: 6 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Showing that a shop can be ordered from on a phone: a menu, a catalogue, a price list.\n- A walkthrough of choosing one item from many.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A menu that should be read in full: use menu-price-board.\n- A multi-step checkout: use checkout-flow.\n\nVariables:\n- title (string): Shop name, default \"Warung Sambal Rina\"\n- caption (string): Caption, default \"Pesan dari meja, tanpa antre\"\n- items (string): Menu items, default \"Nasi ayam geprek|Sambal bawang, lalapan|Rp22.000\\nNasi ayam bakar|Bumbu kecap, sambal terasi|Rp25.000\\nMie goreng jawa|Telur, sayur, kerupuk|Rp18.000\\nSoto ayam|Kuah bening, soun|Rp20.000\\nGado-gado|Bumbu kacang, lontong|Rp17.000\\nTempe mendoan|5 potong, sambal kecap|Rp10.000\\nEs teh manis|Gelas besar|Rp5.000\\nEs jeruk peras|Segar, tanpa pengawet|Rp8.000\\nKopi tubruk|Gula aren|Rp7.000\"\n- tap_item (number, 1-12): Tapped item, default 6\n- button (string): Button label, default \"Tambah\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- main_color (color): Main colour, default \"#2563eb\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- phone_color (color): Phone colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- screen_color (color): Screen colour, default \"#ffffff\"\n- font_family (string): Font, default \"Geist\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
